WEBVTT

00:09:28.897 --> 00:09:33.485
And we can be a realist in aligning
ourselves with this long arc of history

00:09:33.485 --> 00:09:35.904
and embracing problems as opportunities.

00:09:36.405 --> 00:09:37.698
With optimism,

00:09:37.698 --> 00:09:41.619
we can use it as a power
to kind of create the future that we want.

00:09:43.037 --> 00:09:44.038
This is the way.

00:09:44.330 --> 00:09:45.331
Thank you.

00:09:45.456 --> 00:09:46.457
(Applause)